{"message":"I can help coordinate this, but I need to verify your identity before accessing or changing your accounts. Please provide your full name and any two of the following exactly as they appear on your profile: date of birth (MM/DD/YYYY), email address, phone number, or mailing address.

Based on the product information available, the Gold Account has a 5.5% base APY and requires a $10,000 ongoing balance, so your $25,000 would meet that requirement. A Gold Rewards Card may add a relationship bonus, and some checking/savings combinations can provide additional APY boosts. I’ll check your eligibility and the applicable options after verification.

For checking, the Bluest Account offers the strongest documented general perks, including 2.25% APY, 10 free domestic outgoing wires monthly, up to $50 in monthly ATM rebates, a dedicated personal banker, and no Rho-Bank foreign ATM fee. However, we should open the replacement checking account before closing your Light Blue Account because a personal savings account requires at least one active Rho-Bank checking account. Once verified, I’ll check the Light Blue account’s status, balance, pending transactions, age, and closure fee before proceeding."}

